WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.250
The Place Where we Arrive

00:12.330 --> 00:13.980
Just like a migrating bird,

00:15.420 --> 00:18.880
I can remember a few places I recently transferred from.

00:19.550 --> 00:21.460
But I can't remember every place that I've—

00:21.460 --> 00:25.840
Why do you have a facial expression like that, Kouhei?

00:25.840 --> 00:28.550
It's not nice to upset everyone!

00:28.550 --> 00:30.280
Come on, over here.

00:30.280 --> 00:33.850
Wait a minute, I'll be there in a bit.

00:33.850 --> 00:35.430
That's cruel.

00:35.650 --> 00:37.470
I'll be done soon.

00:37.470 --> 00:38.350
All right.

00:38.350 --> 00:40.200
Come over quickly, Kouhei.

00:45.430 --> 00:49.740
I try to not get into relationships with others when I'm only somewhere temporarily, like a travel—

00:52.280 --> 00:55.590
You're ruining the fun, Hasekura-kun.

00:56.450 --> 00:57.620
You, too, Vice President?!

00:58.230 --> 01:00.780
You're up next, Hasekura-senpai.

01:00.780 --> 01:03.790
It's such a rare chance. You should enjoy it with us, too, Kouhei-kun.

01:03.790 --> 01:06.290
That's right, after all, this is...

01:06.510 --> 01:11.280
The Successful Cultural Festival Commemoration Tour!

01:13.710 --> 01:15.010
You're right!

02:51.650 --> 02:53.650
It's really pretty!

02:56.910 --> 02:58.940
So cool!

03:00.610 --> 03:02.030
It's big. {That's what she said?}

03:02.030 --> 03:03.290
How wonderful.

03:04.520 --> 03:09.320
Even soldiers who fight on the battlefield called the Student Council every day need breaks.

03:09.320 --> 03:13.730
Let's allow our tired bodies a break, and relax ourselves.

03:11.400 --> 03:12.880
Let's go, Shiro.

03:13.730 --> 03:15.340
First!

03:20.350 --> 03:22.160
It's really big! {And again... This is looking to be more sexual than our Lilpri/Madoka troll}

03:23.240 --> 03:25.020
The inside is wonderful, too!

03:25.020 --> 03:27.600
It's pretty good for something Nii-san picked.

03:27.820 --> 03:30.320
Look, there's even a second floor!

03:34.680 --> 03:36.110
Shiro-chan seems to be having fun.

03:36.110 --> 03:38.580
Even <i>my</i> level of tension is rising!

03:38.580 --> 03:41.000
Having a trip like this together...

03:41.000 --> 03:43.380
it's great!

03:43.380 --> 03:46.900
Thanks for inviting us, too, Sendou-san.

03:46.900 --> 03:51.620
Don't worry about it. You two have been helping us a lot.

03:51.890 --> 03:52.950
Me, too.

03:54.190 --> 03:58.930
That aside, isn't this place a little too big?

03:58.930 --> 04:00.920
Not at all.

04:00.920 --> 04:05.240
Even though it'll only be two short days, we'll have nine people eating and sleeping here.

04:05.240 --> 04:08.720
This is a quite normal size for all of us to calmly enjoy our break.

04:08.720 --> 04:10.240
Nine people?

04:11.730 --> 04:13.600
Is everyone staying here?!

04:13.600 --> 04:16.190
Aren't the guys staying in another villa?

04:16.190 --> 04:19.840
It wouldn't be a gathering if we stayed apart.

04:19.840 --> 04:21.070
Is there a problem?

04:21.280 --> 04:22.780
There are a lot of them.

04:23.710 --> 04:26.780
For young boys and girls to stay under the same roof...

04:27.230 --> 04:31.160
Don't you stay under the same roof at Hakuhou Hall?

04:31.160 --> 04:32.400
Why are you worrying about it <i>now</i>?

04:32.400 --> 04:34.080
That's not the problem!

04:34.080 --> 04:36.830
It any case, it's immoral!

04:37.110 --> 04:41.190
It's fine, the guys and girls will be properly split up.

04:41.730 --> 04:43.650
The Yuki sisters are staying in that room.

04:43.650 --> 04:46.530
Erika, Shiro-chan, and Kuze-chan are staying there{in that room}.

04:47.260 --> 04:50.030
And of course, Sei is sleeping{sleeping} with me.

04:50.030 --> 04:51.780
Don't give me that creepy laugh.

04:52.870 --> 04:54.280
It's beautiful!

04:56.320 --> 04:58.230
It's just like a painting!

04:59.060 --> 05:02.740
The view of the stars from here at night must be beautiful!

05:03.650 --> 05:07.740
I want to sleep up here tonight, Nii-sama!

05:07.740 --> 05:11.670
All right, all the girls will be sleeping on the second floor!

05:11.670 --> 05:16.370
Everyone? There's no need to squeeze yourselves into that cramped space.

05:16.610 --> 05:18.030
No way...

05:19.110 --> 05:20.210
Shiro...

05:20.470 --> 05:22.760
Watching the stars scattered across the sky...

05:22.760 --> 05:24.420
That seems pretty nice.

05:26.760 --> 05:28.810
It seems safer on the second floor, too.

05:28.810 --> 05:30.220
I won't do anything!

05:31.760 --> 05:32.460
Iori.

05:33.770 --> 05:38.230
If it's not an inconvenience, will you allow Shiro to sleep there?

05:40.560 --> 05:44.190
Well, it's fine if Sei says so.

05:44.420 --> 05:46.050
It's decided, then.

05:46.050 --> 05:48.000
Isn't that great, Shiro-chan?

05:49.430 --> 05:50.830
Yay!

05:51.400 --> 05:54.830
Thank you very much, Iori-senpai, Nii-sama!

06:03.540 --> 06:05.060
It feels nice.

06:06.160 --> 06:08.580
The water is so clear.

06:12.650 --> 06:14.080
It's cold!

06:19.970 --> 06:22.210
Kouhei, Kouhei! There's a boat!

06:22.210 --> 06:23.510
Let's row it together!

06:23.510 --> 06:25.020
I refuse{No way}.

06:25.020 --> 06:28.180
You're probably planning to throw me into the lake anyway.

06:29.090 --> 06:30.560
You got me.

06:30.560 --> 06:32.470
Seriously, Onee-chan...

06:32.470 --> 06:34.090
Oh, Yukimaru!

06:34.770 --> 06:37.370
Wait, Yukimaru!

06:38.480 --> 06:41.830
This is bad; he'll get lost if he gets into the forest.

06:41.830 --> 06:42.650
Let's go!

06:44.720 --> 06:46.210
Yukimaru!

06:46.210 --> 06:48.250
Where are you, Yukimaru?

06:48.250 --> 06:50.180
If you're there, answer me!

06:50.180 --> 06:52.240
I don't think that's possible.

06:57.400 --> 07:00.450
What? He's just here to eat grass.

07:00.450 --> 07:01.980
Thank goodness...

07:08.620 --> 07:10.740
He's been staying in the house at school this whole time.

07:10.740 --> 07:13.160
He's probably surprised to meet one of his kind raised in the wild.

07:13.160 --> 07:14.170
In the house?

07:19.890 --> 07:22.000
I'm the same as Yukimaru.

07:23.100 --> 07:26.760
I rarely come to places like this.

07:28.300 --> 07:30.930
Do you remember, Hasekura-senpai?

07:31.500 --> 07:33.840
The promise you made with me before?

07:34.250 --> 07:38.440
<i>I've never left this island.</i>

07:39.790 --> 07:42.940
<i>In that case, why don't we invite the others to play sometime?</i>

07:44.440 --> 07:46.970
<i>Someday I'll take you to see the world outside this island.</i>

07:46.970 --> 07:48.290
<i>Really?</i>

07:48.290 --> 07:51.090
<i>I'll be in your care, Hasekura-senpai!</i>

07:52.270 --> 07:54.820
Thank you very much, Hasekura-senpai.

07:55.240 --> 07:59.580
It's thanks to you that I can have such an enjoyable trip.

08:00.370 --> 08:02.610
I didn't really do anything.

08:02.610 --> 08:06.590
We took this trip to celebrate a successful cultural festival.

08:06.590 --> 08:09.770
You tried your best during the dance for the festival, too.

08:10.010 --> 08:15.260
But... I only did my best because Hasekura-senpai was there.

08:15.260 --> 08:17.160
That's why I needed to thank you.

08:20.980 --> 08:24.790
What's this? It seems like a pretty nice atmosphere.

08:24.790 --> 08:26.690
Could Shiro-chan...

08:27.070 --> 08:29.470
That's not true, is it?

08:31.900 --> 08:34.890
I have a lot to talk to you about, Hasekura.

08:34.890 --> 08:36.430
What is this "promise"?

08:36.430 --> 08:38.410
What did you and Shiro try your best at?

08:38.410 --> 08:40.910
What we did? It wasn't really...

08:41.110 --> 08:45.420
That's right, Nii-sama, Hasekura-senpai didn't do anything wrong.

08:45.420 --> 08:47.960
I desired all of it!

08:49.190 --> 08:50.380
Desired?

08:50.820 --> 08:51.890
Shiro-chan!

08:51.890 --> 08:54.170
Don't say something so misleading!

08:54.980 --> 08:57.500
Hasekura, you bastard...

08:58.180 --> 08:59.970
You understand, right?

08:59.970 --> 09:02.830
Whether you will see tomorrow depends on your answer!

09:03.490 --> 09:05.000
Oh, this is...

09:05.000 --> 09:07.410
Sei is the same as always.

09:49.070 --> 09:52.730
All right, it's about time for us to take a bath and go to sleep.

09:52.940 --> 09:54.020
You're right.

10:01.300 --> 10:02.970
That felt nice.

10:03.780 --> 10:07.580
Now then, to end the day, it's our fun time before bed.

10:07.580 --> 10:12.420
I want to start a pajama party for girls only by girls!

10:12.620 --> 10:15.830
What do we do in a pajama party?

10:15.830 --> 10:21.770
Girl talk that we don't normally do in front of guys.

10:21.770 --> 10:22.850
Such as?

10:22.850 --> 10:27.760
At a time like this, let's make a big announcement of the guys we're interested in!

10:27.760 --> 10:29.310
So, how about you, Hina-chan?

10:30.330 --> 10:32.660
You don't even need to say; it's Kouhei, right?

10:32.660 --> 10:37.030
That's... but don't you also...

10:37.800 --> 10:41.180
It's not Hachimandaira-senpai for you, Kanade-senpai?

10:41.180 --> 10:42.780
What makes you say that?!

10:42.780 --> 10:46.410
Kouhei is much better than Heiji!{an order of magnitude better}

10:46.410 --> 10:47.370
Just as I thought.

10:48.120 --> 10:50.730
What about you then, Kirikiri?

10:51.630 --> 10:52.490
Me?

10:53.080 --> 10:57.460
You don't seem very interested in guys, Kuze-san.

10:57.460 --> 11:00.680
I'm interested in Hasekura Kouhei.

11:04.850 --> 11:06.890
Kuze-san, you...

11:07.100 --> 11:09.130
No way... it can't be.

11:16.800 --> 11:19.260
I never thought that even Kirikiri would like Kouhei!

11:19.260 --> 11:23.310
We have another rival{challenger}!

11:23.310 --> 11:24.890
What about you, Shiro?

11:24.890 --> 11:28.950
The atmosphere between you and Hasekura-kun seemed pretty good today.

11:30.390 --> 11:32.530
How would I...

11:32.530 --> 11:36.030
That's right! So who is it, Shiro-chan?

11:35.440 --> 11:37.590
Seems like they're having fun upstairs.

11:38.100 --> 11:40.130
This reminds me of the day I moved into the dorms.

11:41.570 --> 11:42.440
This is no good!

11:42.440 --> 11:44.960
Our youth will go to waste if this continues!

11:44.960 --> 11:48.590
When on a student-only trip, you need to barge into the girls' room!

11:48.590 --> 11:51.410
What are you doing?! Take this up there, Hasekura-kun!

11:51.410 --> 11:53.720
You'll break through for us!

11:54.310 --> 11:56.770
The vice president is on the second floor, too.

11:57.200 --> 11:59.230
What kind of brother would push his sister into a lion's den?

12:00.210 --> 12:03.720
Now that it's come to this, just spill it, Shiro-chan!

12:03.720 --> 12:05.010
No way!

12:05.620 --> 12:08.840
I'm granting you permission <i>as</i> the brother! Why are you hesitating?!

12:08.840 --> 12:09.590
Approved!

12:09.590 --> 12:11.270
Dispatch! Expedite!

12:11.270 --> 12:14.620
If you're willing to go that far, why don't you go yourself?

12:16.660 --> 12:18.030
Hey, that...

12:21.710 --> 12:22.970
Who is it?!

12:23.620 --> 12:25.950
Well, then...

12:25.950 --> 12:28.390
The guy I'm interested in is...

12:28.390 --> 12:29.560
Is...?!

12:30.670 --> 12:31.890
Nii-sama. {Incest ftw! :p}

12:34.100 --> 12:35.560
Seiichiro-san?

12:35.780 --> 12:40.060
Yes, he's always cared for me.

12:40.560 --> 12:43.360
I could never thank Nii-sama enough.

12:43.360 --> 12:46.610
That feels like you're cheating.

12:46.610 --> 12:49.670
Togi-senpai is honest and cool.

12:49.670 --> 12:52.120
He's really popular amongst the girls.

12:52.120 --> 12:56.320
Yes, having a brother like him is my biggest pride!

13:03.440 --> 13:04.370
Shiro...

13:05.580 --> 13:08.220
That's how you think of me.

13:09.080 --> 13:11.390
He's a pretty good brother.

13:14.000 --> 13:15.610
Wait a second!

13:16.200 --> 13:19.670
Indeed, I agree that Sei is a good brother.

13:19.670 --> 13:24.260
However, I won't lose when it comes to looks and popularity among girls!

13:24.640 --> 13:26.270
Say it, Erika!

13:26.270 --> 13:29.120
You're also proud of such a brother!

13:29.120 --> 13:30.630
Say it.

13:32.290 --> 13:33.700
Not going to happen!

13:33.940 --> 13:36.550
What are you doing, President?

13:36.550 --> 13:37.960
You, too, Togi-senpai.

13:37.960 --> 13:42.810
Geez, we were going to have some fun just between girls!

13:44.230 --> 13:46.380
Well, it's fine.

13:47.680 --> 13:50.780
All right, change of plans!

13:50.780 --> 13:52.680
Guys can join from now on, too!

13:52.680 --> 13:55.910
It's the fall special of our usual tea party!

13:57.360 --> 13:59.060
I'll eat this!

14:40.040 --> 14:43.240
Now then, let's begin the main event of our recreation trip:

14:43.240 --> 14:46.250
the Iori Cup Tennis Tournament!

14:46.250 --> 14:48.360
I've prepared a really great prize!

14:48.360 --> 14:51.240
Try your hardest and with all your strength, everyone!

14:52.700 --> 14:54.530
Prize?

14:55.250 --> 14:57.540
He's not planning something again, is he?

15:01.280 --> 15:03.450
Be careful, Hina-chan.

15:03.450 --> 15:04.750
Leave it to me.

15:05.630 --> 15:07.070
Bring it on.

15:07.620 --> 15:09.040
Vice President.

15:09.040 --> 15:11.050
You're really getting serious about this.

15:11.050 --> 15:13.320
Relax, I'll do my best for saves.

15:13.320 --> 15:15.180
I'm counting on you to watch my back, Hasekura-kun!

15:19.420 --> 15:21.060
Back...

15:23.340 --> 15:24.310
There!

15:28.240 --> 15:29.970
I got it!

15:35.300 --> 15:37.760
15 - love!

15:45.590 --> 15:49.670
Geez, this isn't fun, Nii-sama.

15:53.260 --> 15:54.480
Shiro...

15:54.480 --> 15:56.770
40 - love!

15:57.750 --> 15:59.310
Final match!

15:59.560 --> 16:03.850
It's finally time for us to settle this, Kouhei.

16:03.850 --> 16:05.280
Settle what?

16:05.630 --> 16:09.740
Speaking of which, we still haven't settled our fight.

16:09.740 --> 16:11.240
Is that so?

16:11.450 --> 16:12.820
Like I said, settle what?

16:14.620 --> 16:15.930
Vice President?!

16:18.110 --> 16:19.770
There!

16:21.430 --> 16:22.350
Vice President!

16:31.590 --> 16:33.220
Amazing...

16:43.790 --> 16:45.290
The match is over!

16:45.290 --> 16:47.230
Winner, Hasekura-Sendo pair!

16:48.600 --> 16:51.270
I haven't had this much exercise in a long time.

16:51.270 --> 16:52.490
Thank you, Kuze-san.

16:53.380 --> 16:54.610
You're welcome.

16:57.500 --> 17:00.080
Is it over already?

17:00.080 --> 17:03.480
The amazing showdown between Eririn and Kirikiri!

17:03.480 --> 17:05.120
That was fantastic!

17:05.120 --> 17:07.100
But I'm all sweaty thanks to that.

17:07.100 --> 17:10.420
Let's take a shower, then it'll be about time to pack up for the trip back.

17:11.520 --> 17:15.930
Shower... that's right.

17:19.820 --> 17:21.920
Don't take it off here!

17:22.510 --> 17:24.520
Well, I expected this to happen.

17:24.520 --> 17:26.460
Don't rush, Kuze-chan.

17:26.460 --> 17:30.450
I told you there'd be a big prize after the competition.

17:31.730 --> 17:33.780
That prize is...

17:34.330 --> 17:38.230
use of the natural springs from the villa's owner!

17:38.230 --> 17:40.280
We can use it as we please!

17:41.150 --> 17:42.380
Natural springs?

17:42.380 --> 17:44.530
I've been waiting for this!

17:44.530 --> 17:47.760
Hot springs are great at the end of trips.

17:47.760 --> 17:54.800
Also, the person cleaning up is decided to be Hasekura-kun, who didn't earn single point in the Iori Cup.

17:54.800 --> 17:57.870
Everyone will head there first, so I leave the clean up to you.

18:00.720 --> 18:02.190
It's brilliant!

18:02.190 --> 18:04.560
I didn't know there was a place like this!

18:04.580 --> 18:06.910
Female

18:04.700 --> 18:06.910
Male

18:07.780 --> 18:09.830
Let's go, everyone!

18:09.830 --> 18:11.440
Let's go, Shiro.

18:11.440 --> 18:13.080
Let's go, too.

18:13.080 --> 18:13.570
Yeah.

18:18.420 --> 18:22.030
What's this Iori Cup? It's just a punishment game.

18:22.030 --> 18:23.220
Male

18:22.030 --> 18:23.220
Female

18:30.980 --> 18:32.090
This feels good.

18:32.310 --> 18:35.000
It really does, I'm glad we came here.

18:35.000 --> 18:37.290
I wish there were an outdoor bathhouse at the dormitory, too.

18:37.290 --> 18:40.590
Can we do that with the student council's power?

18:40.590 --> 18:43.790
People will peek if we build an outdoor bathhouse.

18:43.790 --> 18:45.370
Just like a certain person.

18:46.770 --> 18:49.920
Speaking of which, it seems that has happened before.

18:49.920 --> 18:52.770
Kouhei may barge in here again.

18:53.350 --> 18:55.240
That won't happen again.

18:57.450 --> 18:59.990
I'm finally done. All right, I'll head in.{So obvious that he's about to barge into the girl's bath house...}

19:01.620 --> 19:04.130
See, nothing happened, right?

19:04.130 --> 19:06.150
You can't relax just yet.

19:06.150 --> 19:08.010
Kouhei is Mr. Girls' Bath.

19:09.590 --> 19:12.170
Oh, seems pretty big.

19:22.140 --> 19:23.930
Kouhei...

19:23.930 --> 19:24.640
-kun?

19:34.010 --> 19:38.010
I meant the bath house is big!

19:40.130 --> 19:41.410
Really...

19:41.860 --> 19:44.770
I've heard <i>that</i> before!

19:53.370 --> 19:55.010
Seriously, Nii-san,

19:55.010 --> 19:57.910
what were you thinking, pulling that prank twice?

19:57.910 --> 19:59.050
Seriously.

20:01.500 --> 20:07.160
Well, this is a little reward for Hasekura-kun having worked so hard.

20:07.160 --> 20:08.770
I don't want such a reward again.

20:09.920 --> 20:11.210
He saw it...

20:11.210 --> 20:13.270
Well, isn't it okay?

20:13.270 --> 20:14.820
That's right!

20:14.820 --> 20:17.760
No matter what, we had fun on our trip this time.

20:17.760 --> 20:19.030
Right, Yukimaru?

20:19.030 --> 20:23.970
In that case, why don't we have one last toast for the end of our journey?!

20:25.840 --> 20:26.780
An illusion?!

20:26.780 --> 20:28.950
All right, everyone, have some juice.

20:30.880 --> 20:32.680
Whoa, they're real!

20:32.680 --> 20:34.530
Have some, too, Hasekura-senpai.

20:35.430 --> 20:36.260
Thank you.

20:39.470 --> 20:41.340
I need to thank you, too.

20:42.270 --> 20:43.470
For what?

20:43.470 --> 20:45.860
I've noticed...

20:46.290 --> 20:52.180
The changes in all of us are because you transferred here, Hasekura-kun.

20:52.970 --> 20:56.340
I really thank you from the bottom of my heart.

20:56.340 --> 20:59.880
No way, it was because you're here, Vice President.

20:59.880 --> 21:01.720
I haven't really done anything.

21:12.960 --> 21:17.330
Hey, your blood is really delicious.

21:17.330 --> 21:18.760
Do you know why?

21:19.130 --> 21:20.140
Why?

21:22.200 --> 21:24.940
I definitely won't tell you.

21:38.760 --> 21:40.700
What are you two doing?!

21:40.700 --> 21:42.040
Kouhei-kun!

21:43.560 --> 21:45.580
This is nothing...!

21:45.580 --> 21:48.470
It seems I can't let my guard down.

21:48.470 --> 21:49.990
Erika-senpai...

21:51.370 --> 21:54.500
I'll give you ten discipline stickers, even if you're Eririn!

22:04.130 --> 22:05.910
Just like a migratory bird...

22:10.140 --> 22:11.560
After the migratory bird arrives

22:12.110 --> 22:14.100
at the end of a long journey...

22:42.790 --> 22:46.380
...the important thing is what happens afterward.
